# DevForge — Muhit o'zgaruvchilari
# Bu faylni .env deb nusxalab, o'z qiymatlaringizni kiriting
# .env faylini HECH QACHON git ga qo'shmang!

# ── ASOSIY ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
SECRET_KEY=your-very-secret-key-here-change-this
DEBUG=True
ALLOWED_HOSTS=localhost 127.0.0.1

# ── DATABASE (production uchun) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# SQLite (default, development):
# DATABASE_URL ni bo'sh qoldiring
DATABASE_URL=

# PostgreSQL (production):
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://username:password@localhost:5432/devforge

# ── EMAIL ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
EMAIL_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
EMAIL_PORT=587
EMAIL_HOST_USER=your-email@gmail.com
EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD=your-app-password
DEFAULT_FROM_EMAIL=DevForge <noreply@devforge.uz>

# Gmail App Password olish:
# 1. Google Account → Security → 2-Step Verification → yoqing
# 2. Google Account → Security → App Passwords → "Mail" uchun yarating

# ── AI (Anthropic Claude) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# API key olish: https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key-here

# ── GOOGLE OAUTH ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Olish: https://console.cloud.google.com/ → Credentials → OAuth 2.0
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your-google-client-secret

# ── GITHUB OAUTH ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Olish: https://github.com/settings/developers → New OAuth App
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=your-github-client-id
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=your-github-client-secret

# ── REDIS & CELERY ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
CELERY_BROKER_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
CELERY_RESULT_BACKEND=redis://localhost:6379/0

# ── STRIPE (To'lov tizimi) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Olish: https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys
# Test uchun test key laridan foydalaning (sk_test_...)
STRIPE_PUBLIC_KEY=pk_test_your-stripe-public-key
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_your-stripe-secret-key
# Webhook secret: Stripe Dashboard → Webhooks → Signing secret
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_your-webhook-signing-secret
